# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Garage renovation — git ignore rules
#
#  Principle: commit SOURCE (scripts, CAD, data, docs).
#  Exclude BUILD OUTPUT (renders, meshes, logs, visualizations).
#  Everything excluded here is regenerable from a committed script.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Rendered images (regenerate from CAD/blend sources) ────────────────
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.tiff
*.bmp
*.exr

# ── Backup files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.blend1
*.blend2
*.FCBak
*.FCBak1
*.bak
backups/

# ── Python cache ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.cache/
.pytest_cache/

# ── OS junk ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
._*
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db

# ── Archives ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# ── Logs (build output, regenerable) ───────────────────────────────────
*.log

# ── IDE / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Python virtual environments ────────────────────────────────────────
venv/
.venv/
.venv-*/
*.venv/
env/
site-packages/

# ── Interactive solver visualizations (regenerate from analyze_network.py) ──
*-interactive.html
ALL-interactive.html

# ── Plotly 3D viewers (regenerate from build_study.py / coordinated_study.py) ──
*-3d.html
parametric-*.html

# ── Generated mesh exports (regenerate from build_scene.py) ───────────
*.glb

# ── Vendored third-party viewer library ───────────────────────────────
model-viewer.min.js

# ── Bulk utility rate exports (re-downloadable from CPUC MIDAS) ───────
*MIDAS.csv
*MIDAS.xml

# ── Large solver network dumps (regenerate from study scripts) ─────────
# The JSON study results and member schedules ARE committed; only the
# multi-MB explicit network dumps are excluded.
*complete.network.json
*roof_first.network.json

# ── Generated mesh dumps (derived from .FCStd via build_cad.py) ────────
*-cad-mesh.json
*-mesh.json
visible-mesh*.json

# ── Agent scratch / progress ───────────────────────────────────────────
*progress.txt
*agent-result.json

# ── Nested repos ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
wiki-publish/.git/

# ── Node ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
